status: 409
content-security-policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; connect-src 'self'
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>Your privacy — Taptime</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/app.css"></head><body class="min-h-screen bg-porcelain text-ink antialiased"><main class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-md flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-8"><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-tappa-green">taptime</span> <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/70">punchless</span></header><div class="wizard"><nav aria-label="Setup progress"><p class="docket-label">Step <span class="num">2</span> of <span class="num">4</span> · Privacy</p><ol class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5" role="list"><li class="wizard-segment wizard-segment--done"><span class="sr-only">Welcome</span></li><li class="wizard-segment wizard-segment--done" aria-current><span class="sr-only">Privacy</span></li><li class="wizard-segment"><span class="sr-only">Get ready</span></li><li class="wizard-segment"><span class="sr-only">Tap</span></li></ol></nav><section class="wizard-panel"><p class="docket-label">Your privacy</p><h1 class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink">What Taptime records — and what it never does.</h1></section><section class="border-l-4 border-tomato bg-paper px-4 py-4"><p class="font-display font-bold tracking-tight">This phone belongs to someone else</p><div class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/85"><p>It is signed in as <span class="font-bold">Maria Borg — Kebab Factory Ltd</span></p><p class="mt-2">Finishing setup hands this phone to Probe Beta Employee and signs Maria Borg out of it.</p><p class="mt-2 font-bold text-ink">If you did not expect this, close the page and tell your manager. Their hours are recorded on this phone.</p></div></section><section class="docket wizard-panel"><ul class="flex flex-col gap-4 font-display text-sm text-ink/85" role="list"><li><p class="text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">What a tap records</p><p class="mt-0.5">When you touch the plaque, Taptime saves the time, your phone's internet (IP) address and — only at that moment — your location. Nothing runs in the background and nothing is recorded between taps.</p></li><li><p class="text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">No fingerprints. Ever.</p><p class="mt-0.5">Taptime collects no biometric data of any kind: no fingerprints, no face, no voice. Your phone's own screen lock stays private to your phone.</p></li><li><p class="text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">How long records are kept</p><p class="mt-0.5">Your attendance records are kept for <span class="num font-bold">2</span> years, as set by your employer.</p></li><li><p class="text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Who is responsible</p><p class="mt-0.5">Probe Beta Ltd is the controller of these records; Taptime processes them on their behalf. To see, correct or ask about your data, speak to your manager.</p></li></ul><p class="mt-4 border-t border-line pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Non-production deployment: the retention period above is read from this server's configuration and is a placeholder value, not legal advice.</p></section><form method="post" action="/api/activate" class="wizard-actions"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="TESTcsrfTESTcsrfTESTcsrfTESTcsrfTESTcsrf123"> <label class="flex items-start gap-3 border-l-4 border-tomato bg-paper px-4 py-4"><input type="checkbox" name="switch" value="yes" required class="mt-0.5 h-6 w-6 shrink-0 accent-tomato"> <span class="text-sm text-ink/85">I understand this signs Maria Borg out of this phone.</span></label> <section class="border-l-4 border-tomato bg-paper px-4 py-4"><div class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/85"><span class="font-bold text-ink">Nothing was changed. Tick the box above if you really mean to take this phone over.</span></div></section><label class="wizard-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required class="mt-0.5 h-6 w-6 shrink-0 accent-tappa-green"> <span class="text-sm text-ink/85">I have read what Taptime records and how long it is kept.</span></label> <p class="text-center text-sm text-ink/70">Setting up this phone for <span class="font-bold text-ink">Probe Beta Employee</span> at <span class="font-bold text-ink">Probe Beta Ltd</span></p><button type="submit" class="tap-button">Agree and continue</button> <a href="/activate?step=1" class="wizard-back">Back</a></form></div></main></body></html>